{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux疑似缓冲区溢出攻击。对应需求：安全检测。官方：Potential Buffer Overflow Attack Detected。","from":"now-9m","index":[".alerts-security.*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux疑似缓冲区溢出攻击","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"b7c05aaf-78c2-4558-b069-87fa25973489","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 安全检测","来源: 默认","对应需求: 安全检测"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"threshold","query":"kibana.alert.rule.rule_id:\"5c81fc9d-1eae-437f-ba07-268472967013\" and host.os.type:linux and event.kind:signal\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux疑似缓冲区溢出攻击\n\n### 为何重要\n可能表示异常活动\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","threshold":{"field":["event.kind","host.id"],"value":100},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1068","name":"Exploitation for Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1068/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1190","name":"Exploit Public-Facing Application","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":5,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"de